WEBVTT

01:44.680 --> 01:45.320
Looks like

01:45.880 --> 01:47.360
things with different natures

01:48.280 --> 01:49.360
just don't go together.

01:50.720 --> 01:51.800
Throw it away then.

01:53.160 --> 01:53.800
Not necessarily.

01:55.840 --> 01:56.640
Mr. Qing, look.

01:58.200 --> 01:59.240
Put some clay pebbles at the bottom

02:16.440 --> 02:17.360
and then water it,

02:22.160 --> 02:22.760
it'll help

02:22.760 --> 02:23.680
lower the temperature.

02:25.560 --> 02:26.880
Plants do have their own growth cycles,

02:27.520 --> 02:29.040
but you can work around them.

02:29.520 --> 02:30.680
Even if it struggles in summer,

02:30.800 --> 02:31.800
it won't die that easily.

02:32.320 --> 02:33.560
Actually, plants are far more

02:34.320 --> 02:35.680
resilient than we give them credit for.

02:42.200 --> 02:43.079
Go get Ye.

02:43.320 --> 02:44.200
Come with me somewhere.

02:58.520 --> 02:59.000
Mr. Qing.

02:59.160 --> 02:59.680
Meng,

03:00.560 --> 03:01.800
you look better today.

03:02.320 --> 03:02.840
Dad,

03:03.360 --> 03:04.720
why did you invite him?

03:06.600 --> 03:07.240
Ruihang,

03:07.680 --> 03:08.360
long time no see.

03:09.640 --> 03:10.560
What brings you here today?

03:16.000 --> 03:16.600
Meng,

03:17.160 --> 03:18.800
what are you shooting for today?

03:20.440 --> 03:21.040
Around 80, I think.

03:21.360 --> 03:22.360
Keeping it low-key, huh?

03:22.360 --> 03:23.400
Shouldn't you be aiming for sub-70?

03:23.560 --> 03:25.120
Mr. Qing, with you here,

03:25.120 --> 03:25.800
I'm feeling the pressure.

03:26.440 --> 03:27.200
You've

03:27.680 --> 03:28.640
always had a sweet tongue.

03:30.360 --> 03:30.800
Xing Wu,

03:30.800 --> 03:32.000
how's your golf game?

03:33.280 --> 03:34.240
Mr. Qing,

03:34.520 --> 03:36.079
he has his studies

03:36.280 --> 03:37.320
and work to juggle.

03:37.360 --> 03:38.240
He doesn't have time for golf.

03:38.320 --> 03:39.440
Unlike me, I got plenty of time.

03:41.560 --> 03:42.040
Mr. Qing,

03:42.440 --> 03:43.360
how would you like to play?

03:58.840 --> 03:59.800
Impressive.

03:59.840 --> 04:00.800
Great shot.

04:01.120 --> 04:01.640
Nice.

04:08.160 --> 04:08.720
Just short.

04:09.600 --> 04:11.040
170 yards,

04:11.080 --> 04:12.000
pin high, fried egg.

04:12.040 --> 04:13.240
Nice shot.

04:13.960 --> 04:14.840
That's surprising.

04:15.480 --> 04:16.120
Just got lucky.

04:31.200 --> 04:31.840
Beautiful.

04:32.040 --> 04:33.240
Not bad.

04:42.240 --> 04:44.000
You've got a solid swing.

04:45.400 --> 04:46.640
Just feeling it today.

04:52.159 --> 04:53.520
Oh, right,

04:54.120 --> 04:54.920
what's your job?

04:55.760 --> 04:57.400
I'm at Aofei Group.

04:57.760 --> 04:59.440
He works in aircraft design.

05:02.400 --> 05:03.600
That's a promising field.

05:04.600 --> 05:05.440
Bright future ahead.

05:06.240 --> 05:07.080
You flatter me.

05:07.600 --> 05:10.000
I'm still a graduate student,

05:10.520 --> 05:11.760
not officially on staff yet.

05:14.240 --> 05:14.800
Mr. Qing,

05:15.200 --> 05:16.440
what Xing Wu's achieved

05:16.440 --> 05:17.280
is already remarkable.

05:17.760 --> 05:19.320
He did it all on his own.

05:19.760 --> 05:20.520
Unlike me,

05:20.800 --> 05:22.960
nicely put, I'm following dad's footsteps.

05:23.280 --> 05:24.320
Honestly?

05:24.720 --> 05:25.640
I'm just living off him.

05:26.400 --> 05:27.840
What I admire most is

05:27.840 --> 05:28.920
people like you and Xing Wu,

05:28.960 --> 05:29.760
self-made,

05:29.800 --> 05:30.760
everything earned through hard work.

05:31.400 --> 05:33.080
You're always good with words.

05:35.320 --> 05:36.159
We've been playing for a while.

05:36.159 --> 05:37.120
Go get us some water.

05:37.280 --> 05:38.320
Take Ye with you.

05:43.760 --> 05:44.280
Okay.

05:52.440 --> 05:53.080
Xing,

05:53.640 --> 05:55.240
how are you so good at this?

05:56.560 --> 05:57.560
I've played a few rounds

05:57.560 --> 05:58.720
with a client before.

05:59.120 --> 06:00.800
A few rounds and you play like this?

06:01.520 --> 06:02.200
Maybe

06:03.040 --> 06:04.400
because growing up the way I did,

06:04.760 --> 06:06.240
I pick things up fast.

06:08.920 --> 06:10.560
Ye's the same.

06:12.560 --> 06:13.280
Too bad

06:14.440 --> 06:15.560
I was too caught up in work

06:15.560 --> 06:16.760
to spend more time with her.

06:17.520 --> 06:18.520
I owe her a lot.

06:20.440 --> 06:21.040
So

06:21.040 --> 06:22.560
I want her with someone

06:23.400 --> 06:24.760
who'll treat her right.

06:28.280 --> 06:28.960
I understand.

06:29.520 --> 06:30.440
Mr. Qing, don't worry.

06:31.680 --> 06:32.760
From now on,

06:32.880 --> 06:33.880
I'll work harder.

06:34.760 --> 06:36.200
I'll give her a better life.

06:37.280 --> 06:38.520
Remember what you said.

06:39.640 --> 06:40.640
Don't let me down.

06:47.520 --> 06:48.520
My dad's

06:48.840 --> 06:51.280
been in business for so long.

06:52.320 --> 06:54.000
He doesn't trust people easily.

06:54.680 --> 06:56.080
Don't take it personally.

06:57.240 --> 06:57.840
I won't.

06:58.520 --> 06:59.520
Think about it another way.

06:59.920 --> 07:00.720
It means your dad

07:01.080 --> 07:02.240
got to know me better.

07:02.400 --> 07:02.960
It's a good thing.

07:05.320 --> 07:07.240
Mr. Qing is pretty shrewd.

07:07.640 --> 07:08.960
Pretending it was just a round of golf,

07:09.240 --> 07:11.000
but actually sizing up his future son-in-law.

07:11.200 --> 07:12.520
He even dragged me along.

07:13.920 --> 07:15.200
But congrats

07:15.600 --> 07:16.920
on getting his approval.

07:18.640 --> 07:19.760
Thanks for today.

07:21.080 --> 07:22.160
So I

07:22.160 --> 07:24.160
did my part

07:24.160 --> 07:24.920
for your relationship.

07:26.320 --> 07:27.040
Let's set a time.

07:27.360 --> 07:28.240
I'll treat you to dinner

07:28.600 --> 07:29.280
as thanks

07:29.280 --> 07:30.200
for your help today.

07:32.640 --> 07:33.600
Let's put dinner on hold

07:34.000 --> 07:35.040
until I'm back from abroad.

07:36.200 --> 07:37.000
You're going abroad?

07:38.560 --> 07:39.400
For further studies.

07:40.040 --> 07:40.840
So suddenly?

07:41.680 --> 07:42.640
Well, he stole

07:42.800 --> 07:44.080
my first love.

07:45.240 --> 07:46.640
So I have to leave

07:46.640 --> 07:47.440
and heal my broken heart.

07:47.960 --> 07:49.040
Because of me?

07:49.680 --> 07:50.640
When are you coming back?

07:51.280 --> 07:52.920
When I've made

07:53.320 --> 07:54.400
something of myself.

07:54.880 --> 07:55.560
Alright.

07:55.800 --> 07:57.400
Come visit when you're back.

07:57.840 --> 07:58.600
I'll be waiting.

07:59.040 --> 07:59.520
Sure.

08:01.040 --> 08:02.800
It's still early. Wanna have some coffee?

08:03.960 --> 08:04.840
- I've got stuff to do.
- I've got things to do.

08:09.040 --> 08:09.560
Fine.

08:10.280 --> 08:11.520
I'll go by myself.

08:28.520 --> 08:29.040
Ye?

08:32.080 --> 08:32.799
Ruihang?

08:35.159 --> 08:36.080
I brought you breakfast.

08:36.360 --> 08:37.039
Your favorite.

08:37.360 --> 08:38.039
Thanks.

08:38.280 --> 08:38.760
Let's go.

08:38.880 --> 08:39.320
Okay.

08:53.440 --> 08:55.920
That wraps up today's tutorial

08:56.120 --> 08:57.360
on this updo style.

08:57.560 --> 08:58.800
If you want to learn more,

08:58.880 --> 09:01.440
give me a follow,

09:01.520 --> 09:03.040
hit that

09:03.040 --> 09:03.640
like button,

09:03.640 --> 09:04.600
or join my

09:04.600 --> 09:05.600
fan club.

09:05.840 --> 09:07.560
There's a full

09:07.720 --> 09:09.520
tutorial series.

09:09.760 --> 09:11.240
Guaranteed you'll pick it up.

09:11.440 --> 09:11.920
All right,

09:11.960 --> 09:13.440
everyone, that's it

09:13.440 --> 09:15.400
for today's stream.

09:15.960 --> 09:17.000
See you in...

09:17.120 --> 09:17.760
Are you offline?

09:18.280 --> 09:19.440
Not yet, almost.

09:20.360 --> 09:21.360
Say hi to everyone.

09:22.360 --> 09:23.360
Don't forget

09:23.880 --> 09:25.520
to like and subscribe.

09:26.120 --> 09:26.680
Should I cut the stream?

09:26.680 --> 09:27.200
Yeah, go ahead.

09:27.400 --> 09:28.320
See you next time.

09:28.320 --> 09:29.160
Bye.

09:30.640 --> 09:31.120
Alright.

09:31.680 --> 09:32.880
A lot of people watched

09:32.880 --> 09:33.800
your stream today.

09:33.800 --> 09:35.240
So many viewers.

09:35.240 --> 09:36.320
Not bad, not bad.

09:36.720 --> 09:37.800
I just don't get it.

09:37.800 --> 09:39.400
Why does nobody watch

09:39.520 --> 09:40.920
my cooking stream?

09:42.160 --> 09:43.760
It's slow for

09:43.760 --> 09:45.720
everyone at the start.

09:45.720 --> 09:47.200
The key is consistency.

09:47.720 --> 09:48.320
I didn't

09:48.320 --> 09:49.440
have many viewers either at first,

09:49.520 --> 09:50.360
but I kept

09:50.360 --> 09:51.560
streaming every day.

09:52.000 --> 09:52.880
Then one day

09:52.920 --> 09:53.800
out of nowhere

09:54.120 --> 09:55.840
the numbers just shot up.

09:56.160 --> 09:57.480
Turns out

09:57.520 --> 09:59.280
I had caught

09:59.400 --> 10:00.920
the updo trend.

10:02.200 --> 10:03.520
What trend can I jump on?

10:03.560 --> 10:04.440
Maybe stop

10:04.920 --> 10:06.600
streaming cooking all the time.

10:06.840 --> 10:07.760
Isn't showing talent

10:07.760 --> 10:09.280
and doing girl group dances

10:09.520 --> 10:11.720
really popular these days?

10:11.920 --> 10:13.120
Didn't you learn

10:13.120 --> 10:14.240
dance before?

10:14.440 --> 10:15.720
Film a video,

10:16.000 --> 10:17.160
throw in some moves,

10:17.160 --> 10:18.280
and post it.

10:18.320 --> 10:19.720
Then we can pull in

10:19.880 --> 10:20.720
some followers too.

10:21.240 --> 10:22.520
That's a good idea.

10:22.520 --> 10:23.160
Right?

10:23.440 --> 10:24.520
Then my trainee days

10:24.520 --> 10:25.600
and dance practice

10:25.600 --> 10:27.120
won't go to waste.

10:27.120 --> 10:27.520
Right.

10:27.560 --> 10:28.320
Great idea.

10:28.640 --> 10:29.360
Yeah, right.

10:29.360 --> 10:30.360
But I can't do

10:30.360 --> 10:31.320
a girl group dance alone.

10:31.720 --> 10:32.160
How about

10:32.160 --> 10:33.520
you two join me?

10:34.040 --> 10:34.960
Us two?

10:35.040 --> 10:36.600
I can't dance.

10:36.600 --> 10:37.440
Count me out.

10:37.760 --> 10:38.320
I...

10:38.400 --> 10:38.880
I...

10:38.960 --> 10:40.040
I can help with the hair.

10:40.240 --> 10:41.600
But dancing? Please spare me.

10:47.760 --> 10:49.040
I'm going to miss you.

10:49.840 --> 10:50.640
Me too.

10:51.200 --> 10:52.160
We'll see each other tomorrow.

10:58.800 --> 10:59.320
Hello?

10:59.840 --> 11:01.520
[Wu, I need a favor.]

11:02.000 --> 11:02.520
What's up?

11:02.960 --> 11:04.520
[I met a girl I really like.]

11:04.640 --> 11:06.000
[I wanna bring her over for a movie,]

11:06.320 --> 11:07.720
[but I don't want my sister to find out.]

11:08.520 --> 11:09.520
[Can I crash at your place tonight?]

11:10.320 --> 11:11.440
When did this happen?

11:11.800 --> 11:12.640
[Just a couple days ago.]

11:12.800 --> 11:13.440
[We're still chatting.]

11:14.040 --> 11:15.240
[Come on, yes or no?]

11:17.040 --> 11:18.280
If you're at my place,

11:18.760 --> 11:19.520
where do I go?

11:20.360 --> 11:21.320
[Please work something out.]

11:29.320 --> 11:29.840
Fine.

11:30.400 --> 11:31.760
I'll send you the door lock code.

11:32.120 --> 11:32.720
[Thanks.]

12:05.680 --> 12:07.040
I bought this not long ago.

12:07.200 --> 12:08.160
It should fit you.

12:09.040 --> 12:09.560
Okay.

12:09.800 --> 12:10.640
I'll go take a shower.

12:11.960 --> 12:12.840
Bathroom's over there.

12:28.560 --> 12:29.240
Well,

12:29.800 --> 12:30.640
toothbrush

12:31.360 --> 12:32.680
and hair dryer

12:33.200 --> 12:34.160
are in the drawer.

12:34.360 --> 12:35.760
You'll see them when you open it.

12:36.520 --> 12:37.040
Okay.

12:45.200 --> 12:45.800
I see them.

12:48.080 --> 12:49.400
Let me know if you need anything else.

12:49.880 --> 12:50.400
Okay.

13:21.520 --> 13:22.120
[Save me]

13:22.160 --> 13:23.200
[a seat at the main table.]

13:25.120 --> 13:25.840
[Congratulations.]

13:27.280 --> 13:27.880
[Wu,]

13:28.080 --> 13:29.360
[bring Ye back during the holiday.]

13:31.720 --> 13:32.880
[Finally got your girl.]

13:34.520 --> 13:35.120
[That's it!]

13:35.440 --> 13:36.920
[When you love someone, you say it.]

13:37.240 --> 13:38.280
[When's the wedding?]

13:56.640 --> 13:57.320
Ye?

14:00.640 --> 14:01.240
Ye?

14:46.000 --> 14:46.760
I love you.

14:49.880 --> 14:50.640
I love you too.

15:51.880 --> 15:52.920
So the dance...

15:52.920 --> 15:53.520
What's up?

15:53.880 --> 15:55.440
Wait, you didn't hit the button.

15:55.640 --> 15:56.800
You didn't even hit the button.

15:56.800 --> 15:58.560
You didn't press the round button.

15:58.560 --> 16:00.160
What are you doing, Cici?

16:00.440 --> 16:01.320
I quit.

16:01.320 --> 16:02.040
I've been working all day.

16:02.040 --> 16:03.040
My husband finally came home.

16:03.040 --> 16:04.200
I need to go back.

16:04.200 --> 16:05.120
Just do it one more time.

16:05.120 --> 16:05.800
No.

16:05.800 --> 16:07.040
My husband's waiting for me at home.

16:07.040 --> 16:08.200
I'm exhausted.

16:08.240 --> 16:09.080
Just dance one more with me.

16:09.080 --> 16:09.680
Lanfang,

16:10.520 --> 16:11.160
check this out.

16:11.440 --> 16:13.200
Wu posted something on Moments.

16:13.560 --> 16:14.000
Really?

16:14.040 --> 16:14.960
- What's going on?
- What did he post?

16:15.720 --> 16:16.200
Wait.

16:16.520 --> 16:18.360
Is he going public with his relationship?

16:18.720 --> 16:20.400
Who is it, anyway?

16:21.040 --> 16:22.640
Just two backs of hands.

16:22.680 --> 16:25.160
Who can tell who that is? Silly boy.

16:26.840 --> 16:28.920
Ye?

16:30.040 --> 16:31.240
Lanfang,

16:31.400 --> 16:33.240
shouldn't you be treating us to dinner?

16:34.000 --> 16:35.200
No problem.

16:35.640 --> 16:37.520
I should.

16:38.000 --> 16:38.960
But what excuse

16:38.960 --> 16:40.040
can I use to get them

16:40.040 --> 16:41.520
to come back?

16:41.640 --> 16:43.080
Dance and make our group debut.

16:44.120 --> 16:45.560
Then maybe they shouldn't come back.

16:45.640 --> 16:46.160
Wait.

16:46.560 --> 16:48.320
Isn't the Dragon Boat Festival coming soon?

16:48.520 --> 16:50.520
Tell them to come back for the holiday meal.

16:50.920 --> 16:52.000
Then we can ask

16:52.040 --> 16:53.120
if this is actually true.

16:54.080 --> 16:54.800
Good idea.

16:54.800 --> 16:56.320
It won't get in the way of their work.

16:56.440 --> 16:56.920
Exactly.

16:56.920 --> 16:57.520
I'll ask them right now.

16:57.520 --> 16:58.080
No, wait.

16:58.080 --> 16:59.240
Dance with me one more time first.

16:59.320 --> 17:00.600
I can't dance now.

17:00.840 --> 17:02.520
I'm making the call.

17:19.839 --> 17:20.280
Hello?

17:20.720 --> 17:21.280
[Wu,]

17:21.599 --> 17:22.800
[I saw your post.]

17:23.400 --> 17:24.640
[You're off for Dragon Boat Festival?]

17:24.839 --> 17:26.200
[Bring Ye back for the holiday.]

17:28.000 --> 17:28.640
Okay.

17:29.920 --> 17:30.600
I...

17:31.400 --> 17:32.120
I'll ask her.

17:32.400 --> 17:33.120
I'll tell her about it.

17:52.200 --> 17:52.880
Go take it.

17:54.320 --> 17:55.320
Hello, Mr. Zhu?

17:56.800 --> 17:58.600
Are you calling for the gossip too?

17:58.760 --> 17:59.960
[What gossip?]

18:00.000 --> 18:01.000
[I'm calling about something serious.]

18:01.520 --> 18:02.320
Go ahead. What's it?

18:02.680 --> 18:03.760
[I heard from your mom]

18:04.080 --> 18:05.320
[you'll be back for the holiday,]

18:05.320 --> 18:05.800
[right?]

18:05.920 --> 18:07.200
If you're coming back,

18:07.200 --> 18:08.960
make some time to drop by school.

18:09.320 --> 18:10.760
Talk to the kids

18:10.800 --> 18:12.240
in senior year.

18:12.400 --> 18:13.440
[Share some thoughts.]

18:13.520 --> 18:14.320
[Give them a speech.]

18:14.760 --> 18:16.120
[You're an outstanding graduate.]

18:16.120 --> 18:16.880
[Set an example]

18:17.120 --> 18:17.840
[and encourage them.]

18:17.840 --> 18:19.280
What kind of role model am I?

18:19.720 --> 18:21.080
[Why not?]

18:21.680 --> 18:22.840
[For the first three years,]

18:23.520 --> 18:24.680
[you were the classic bad student.]

18:24.960 --> 18:25.800
For the last three,

18:25.800 --> 18:27.240
you turned it all around.

18:27.560 --> 18:28.520
Either way,

18:28.600 --> 18:29.800
no one fits better than you.

18:30.280 --> 18:31.320
Thanks a lot.

18:32.080 --> 18:33.160
You don't know this, Wu.

18:33.360 --> 18:34.880
These kids

18:35.160 --> 18:35.680
are different

18:35.680 --> 18:36.600
from your year.

18:37.400 --> 18:38.160
They don't want

18:38.160 --> 18:39.040
the boring

18:39.040 --> 18:40.520
lectures anymore.

18:40.600 --> 18:42.360
[They like stories about troubled kids]

18:42.360 --> 18:43.520
[who got back on track.]

18:43.800 --> 18:45.360
[Tell them the trouble you made]

18:45.520 --> 18:46.520
[and how you changed.]

18:46.560 --> 18:47.360
Isn't that great?

18:47.360 --> 18:48.240
All right.

18:48.520 --> 18:48.960
Fine.

18:49.040 --> 18:49.520
I'll go.

18:49.720 --> 18:50.560
I'll go, Old Zhu.

18:51.000 --> 18:52.160
[Perfect. Then it's settled.]

18:56.360 --> 18:57.400
Why do they

18:58.520 --> 19:00.000
have to call now?

19:02.280 --> 19:03.560
That's what you get

19:03.960 --> 19:05.520
for making us official tonight.

19:09.160 --> 19:09.880
I was too impatient.

19:15.200 --> 19:16.120
My mom asked if you

19:16.440 --> 19:17.720
have time on Dragon Boat Festival.

19:18.200 --> 19:20.720
She wants me to bring you home.

19:22.880 --> 19:23.880
I'm free.

19:24.520 --> 19:25.360
I just don't know

19:26.280 --> 19:27.520
if Auntie can accept

19:27.520 --> 19:28.880
us being together.

19:28.960 --> 19:30.040
She definitely can.

19:30.080 --> 19:31.400
She'll be thrilled.

19:31.760 --> 19:32.360
Thrilled?

19:32.560 --> 19:34.640
Her niece becomes her son's girlfriend.

19:37.000 --> 19:37.840
She's okay with that?

19:41.040 --> 19:41.920
Don't worry.

19:42.200 --> 19:43.520
My mom's pretty chill.

19:43.960 --> 19:45.640
And she figured it out long ago.

19:46.520 --> 19:47.240
Really?

19:47.560 --> 19:48.440
No wonder

19:48.520 --> 19:49.360
that time I went back,

19:49.360 --> 19:51.000
she said she had to go into town.

19:53.440 --> 19:53.880
Right,

19:54.360 --> 19:55.600
what did Mr. Zhu say?

19:55.840 --> 19:56.680
Something about going back to school?

19:57.040 --> 19:58.520
He wants me to give a speech

19:59.240 --> 20:00.560
to the graduating class.

20:00.920 --> 20:01.920
That's great.

20:02.960 --> 20:03.840
Look at you.

20:05.120 --> 20:06.320
A bottom-of-the-class kid

20:06.520 --> 20:07.400
transformed from

20:08.520 --> 20:12.040
a student on leave to an outstanding graduate,

20:12.800 --> 20:14.040
and now,

20:14.560 --> 20:16.360
what do they call it,

20:16.680 --> 20:17.400
a rising star

20:18.440 --> 20:19.800
in aerospace.

20:20.720 --> 20:21.800
What a story.

20:23.280 --> 20:24.120
It all started

20:24.840 --> 20:26.120
when a girl lost everything

20:27.040 --> 20:28.880
and ended up at Zhazhating.

20:32.280 --> 20:33.200
That's a good opening.

20:33.600 --> 20:34.320
Use that.

20:37.440 --> 20:38.680
But before that,

20:39.800 --> 20:40.760
we need to talk

20:40.760 --> 20:41.600
about us.

21:43.920 --> 21:44.840
I heard Wu's bringing

21:44.840 --> 21:45.960
his girlfriend home this time.

21:46.840 --> 21:48.360
It's his first girlfriend,

21:48.960 --> 21:50.640
and she's from the big city.

21:50.960 --> 21:52.440
I can't let her feel unwelcome.

21:52.560 --> 21:53.080
Look.

21:53.200 --> 21:53.720
I even

21:53.720 --> 21:55.040
bought a new outfit.

21:55.240 --> 21:55.800
Does it look nice?

21:55.960 --> 21:56.840
I can tell.

21:56.880 --> 21:57.400
The necklace

21:57.400 --> 21:58.560
I gave you goes perfectly with it.

21:58.600 --> 22:00.080
I think so too.

22:00.960 --> 22:01.920
Does this outfit

22:01.920 --> 22:02.520
make me look

22:02.520 --> 22:03.520
very cultured?

22:03.720 --> 22:04.640
Of course.

22:05.600 --> 22:06.240
Lanfang,

22:06.240 --> 22:07.200
I keep wondering

22:07.720 --> 22:09.720
what kind of girl

22:09.720 --> 22:10.880
Xing Wu would date.

22:12.320 --> 22:13.360
Maybe she's

22:13.360 --> 22:13.840
a researcher

22:13.840 --> 22:15.200
who builds rockets

22:17.520 --> 22:18.760
and wear heavy glasses.

22:19.720 --> 22:21.040
You'll know when you meet her.

22:40.400 --> 22:41.840
Auntie!

22:41.840 --> 22:42.880
Come give me a hug.

22:43.880 --> 22:45.200
I missed you so much.

22:45.560 --> 22:46.520
I told you not to come

22:46.520 --> 22:47.400
all the way to pick us up.

22:47.560 --> 22:48.960
How could I not come?

22:49.000 --> 22:50.000
Mr. Zhu drove me here

22:50.080 --> 22:50.600
Where is he?

22:50.720 --> 22:51.280
Where is he?

22:51.400 --> 22:52.680
Parking's hard here.

22:52.680 --> 22:53.840
He's waiting outside.

22:53.880 --> 22:55.000
We'll give him a surprise later.

22:55.760 --> 22:56.600
A surprise?

22:57.560 --> 22:58.440
More like a scare.

22:59.000 --> 22:59.960
Look at you.

23:00.000 --> 23:00.840
Finally.

23:01.360 --> 23:02.840
You liked her for so long,

23:02.840 --> 23:04.040
and only now you said it.

23:05.120 --> 23:05.720
Auntie,

23:05.720 --> 23:07.720
I didn't expect you'd seen it all along.

23:07.960 --> 23:09.360
I was worried

23:09.560 --> 23:10.720
you wouldn't

23:10.720 --> 23:12.200
accept us being together.

23:12.720 --> 23:13.640
Told you so.

23:13.800 --> 23:15.120
My mom figured it out ages ago.

23:15.760 --> 23:16.880
Of course. Nothing gets past me.

23:17.560 --> 23:18.280
Let's go.

23:18.280 --> 23:18.840
You happy?

23:18.840 --> 23:19.720
Beyond happy.

23:19.720 --> 23:20.400
Let's go home.

23:20.400 --> 23:21.080
Come on.

23:45.680 --> 23:46.680
Everyone,

23:46.800 --> 23:47.880
here's the big one.

23:48.240 --> 23:48.960
Exclusive deals

23:48.960 --> 23:50.640
for our stream today.

23:50.800 --> 23:51.360
Buy one

23:51.520 --> 23:53.400
jin of fried fish fillets today,

23:53.520 --> 23:55.680
and get one jin of dried fish for free.

23:55.920 --> 23:56.800
Is that enough?

23:57.400 --> 23:57.960
Not enough.

23:58.240 --> 23:59.520
Our pretty chef says it's not enough.

23:59.640 --> 23:59.960
All right.

23:59.960 --> 24:02.400
We'll make it two jin of dried fish.

24:02.800 --> 24:03.920
That's a steal.

24:04.120 --> 24:05.280
Look. We change

24:05.320 --> 24:07.280
our oil every day.

24:07.680 --> 24:08.520
Guys,

24:08.560 --> 24:10.320
no additives,

24:10.560 --> 24:11.560
all natural,

24:12.120 --> 24:13.480
and won't cause any irritation.

24:13.520 --> 24:15.280
Safe for kids and seniors

24:15.320 --> 24:16.040
alike.

24:16.520 --> 24:17.080
Three,

24:17.800 --> 24:18.440
two,

24:19.240 --> 24:19.800
one.

24:20.000 --> 24:21.120
Link's up!

24:23.200 --> 24:23.840
Grandma,

24:24.800 --> 24:25.840
we came to see you.

24:30.600 --> 24:31.360
We have

24:32.360 --> 24:33.760
something important

24:34.680 --> 24:35.520
to tell you today.

24:40.800 --> 24:41.480
Grandma,

24:42.720 --> 24:43.200
look.

24:44.640 --> 24:45.680
We're together now.

25:05.040 --> 25:05.760
Wu.

25:07.560 --> 25:08.200
Grandma,

25:10.280 --> 25:11.400
time to go back.

25:11.680 --> 25:12.360
It's getting cold out here.

25:14.240 --> 25:14.880
Wu,

25:16.160 --> 25:18.120
are you thinking about Ye too,

25:18.720 --> 25:20.280
just like I am?

25:27.160 --> 25:28.720
Even if you don't say it, I know.

25:30.520 --> 25:31.520
Sometimes people

25:31.840 --> 25:33.040
are like the wind.

25:33.600 --> 25:35.200
They come

25:35.720 --> 25:37.440
and go.

25:38.240 --> 25:39.960
If you want to see someone again,

25:40.560 --> 25:42.840
you have to chase them hard.

25:49.360 --> 25:50.560
You're still young.

25:51.760 --> 25:53.520
You have a long road ahead.

25:54.200 --> 25:55.560
Don't get stuck here

25:55.680 --> 25:56.680
like me.

25:57.760 --> 25:59.160
Go out there.

25:59.440 --> 26:00.920
Keep going.

26:02.920 --> 26:04.400
See the world

26:04.840 --> 26:06.320
for me,

26:06.960 --> 26:07.640
okay?

26:12.760 --> 26:13.360
Grandma,

26:13.840 --> 26:14.640
I promise.

26:16.520 --> 26:17.240
Grandma,

26:18.920 --> 26:20.600
Wu has become an outstanding man.

26:21.640 --> 26:23.040
He didn't let you down.

26:23.560 --> 26:24.680
You can rest in peace now.

26:32.360 --> 26:33.320
Rest easy, Grandma.

26:43.400 --> 26:44.640
Grandma started knitting

26:46.000 --> 26:47.600
this scarf for you before she passed.

26:52.600 --> 26:53.280
So

26:56.400 --> 26:57.520
you finished it?

27:03.920 --> 27:04.520
Grandma,

27:04.800 --> 27:05.920
I know how to knit scarves now.

27:09.600 --> 27:10.440
Thank you, Grandma.

27:12.080 --> 27:13.360
I really love this gift.

27:22.600 --> 27:23.160
How is it?

27:23.640 --> 27:24.400
Looking good, right?

27:24.600 --> 27:25.160
Not bad.

27:28.880 --> 27:29.320
No, no.

27:29.320 --> 27:30.560
The filling's spilling out.

27:30.600 --> 27:31.720
You put in too much.

27:32.040 --> 27:33.520
Here, take some out.

27:33.720 --> 27:34.880
You can't wrap it like that.

27:35.160 --> 27:36.360
They're just dating.

27:36.360 --> 27:37.200
Why do you

27:37.240 --> 27:38.440
look so worried?

27:42.040 --> 27:44.280
I am a little worried.

27:44.880 --> 27:45.600
Why?

27:45.600 --> 27:46.640
What's there to worry about?

27:46.720 --> 27:48.520
You've always known

27:48.520 --> 27:50.120
Wu likes Ye.

27:50.240 --> 27:51.120
Yeah.

27:51.360 --> 27:52.320
And they're

27:52.320 --> 27:53.520
not related by blood.

27:53.720 --> 27:55.120
They're not siblings.

27:55.400 --> 27:56.240
Young people falling in love

27:56.240 --> 27:57.400
is a good thing.

27:57.400 --> 27:58.560
What are you worried about?

28:00.160 --> 28:01.680
What worries me is...

28:03.040 --> 28:04.520
I'm happy they're

28:04.520 --> 28:05.200
together.

28:05.520 --> 28:06.520
I'm happy for them.

28:07.080 --> 28:08.240
But I think

28:08.400 --> 28:09.560
the gap between our families

28:09.560 --> 28:10.800
is huge.

28:11.360 --> 28:13.680
You're worrying too much.

28:13.800 --> 28:15.000
What matters is that

28:15.000 --> 28:16.200
they like each other.

28:16.520 --> 28:17.520
Exactly.

28:17.640 --> 28:19.720
And Wu is excellent too.

28:20.040 --> 28:22.120
Tall, handsome, motivated,

28:22.360 --> 28:23.560
and skilled at high tech stuff.

28:23.960 --> 28:25.640
He has a great future ahead.

28:26.600 --> 28:27.640
They'll bring out

28:27.680 --> 28:30.080
the best in each other.

28:30.800 --> 28:31.800
So don't worry.

28:32.520 --> 28:33.640
They’re adults now.

28:33.760 --> 28:34.520
They can

28:34.520 --> 28:36.400
make their own decisions.

28:36.560 --> 28:37.880
Stop worrying about them.

28:37.960 --> 28:38.920
Just let it be.

28:39.080 --> 28:39.680
All right.

28:41.080 --> 28:42.760
Hearing you two say that

28:43.160 --> 28:44.560
really makes me feel

28:45.240 --> 28:46.120
much better.

28:47.000 --> 28:47.600
Fine.

28:48.040 --> 28:49.240
Let it be.

28:49.600 --> 28:50.240
I'll

28:50.560 --> 28:51.280
give them my blessing.

28:51.520 --> 28:51.880
Right.

28:52.200 --> 28:53.840
Let's wish them well.

28:54.280 --> 28:55.240
Let's wrap the zongzi.

28:55.280 --> 28:56.080
Let's do it.

28:59.400 --> 29:00.840
We can stay a few more days this time.

29:01.080 --> 29:02.560
You can eat everything you've been

29:02.640 --> 29:03.320
craving,

29:03.680 --> 29:04.320
like salted fish cakes,

29:04.800 --> 29:05.520
- and seafood noodles.
- Yeah.

29:05.600 --> 29:06.040
Right.

29:06.120 --> 29:07.720
And the steamed egg with sea urchin here

29:07.760 --> 29:08.600
has to be different.

29:08.680 --> 29:09.200
It's fresh.

29:12.440 --> 29:13.160
- You're here?
- Wu.

29:13.520 --> 29:13.960
Ye.

29:13.960 --> 29:15.400
Wu, Ye!

29:15.520 --> 29:16.120
Shi Min?

29:16.920 --> 29:18.600
Come to my place for seafood noodles.

29:19.080 --> 29:20.240
Your ears are sharp.

29:20.240 --> 29:20.840
See?

29:22.840 --> 29:23.400
Wu,

29:23.760 --> 29:24.200
Ye.

29:24.400 --> 29:25.520
Quanya, long time no see.

29:25.600 --> 29:26.160
Long time no see.

29:26.360 --> 29:27.000
Congratulations.

29:27.520 --> 29:28.520
Han asked me

29:28.880 --> 29:29.960
to give you these gifts

29:30.320 --> 29:32.080
with her blessing.

29:32.720 --> 29:33.520
Thank Han for us.

29:33.960 --> 29:34.920
How is she?

29:35.240 --> 29:36.320
She's doing great.

29:36.520 --> 29:38.200
She's doing business overseas with Yingjian.

29:39.600 --> 29:40.120
Then,

29:40.400 --> 29:41.440
let's head inside.

29:41.440 --> 29:42.600
Auntie's waiting for us.

29:42.880 --> 29:43.240
Let's go.

29:43.280 --> 29:44.400
- Come on.
- Let's eat.

29:44.600 --> 29:45.280
Go.

29:47.720 --> 29:51.000
Cheers! Happy Dragon Boat Festival!

29:51.160 --> 29:51.840
This is nice.

29:54.800 --> 29:55.400
Let's eat.

29:56.720 --> 29:58.360
What a feast today.

29:59.920 --> 30:00.640
You know,

30:00.880 --> 30:02.320
we, as elders,

30:03.320 --> 30:04.760
watch you kids

30:04.840 --> 30:05.960
grow up day by day.

30:06.320 --> 30:07.280
Now you've made something of yourselves.

30:08.000 --> 30:08.680
It really

30:09.040 --> 30:10.880
puts our hearts at ease.

30:11.360 --> 30:12.520
Exactly.

30:12.680 --> 30:14.240
The kids are doing well,

30:14.560 --> 30:16.400
and we don't have to worry about them.

30:16.400 --> 30:16.840
Right.

30:17.160 --> 30:18.160
Look at Big G and Shi Min.

30:18.520 --> 30:19.520
Those two are

30:19.520 --> 30:21.080
doing great together.

30:21.080 --> 30:22.440
Mainly because I stayed out of it.

30:23.360 --> 30:24.920
They're all doing

30:25.160 --> 30:25.880
pretty well.

30:26.120 --> 30:27.360
Exactly. Big G,

30:27.520 --> 30:28.240
you became a teacher

30:28.400 --> 30:29.880
and got married this year.

30:29.880 --> 30:30.640
Two milestones in one year.

30:30.720 --> 30:31.840
Come on. Make a toast.

30:32.520 --> 30:33.360
I will.

30:34.320 --> 30:35.120
Then let me

30:35.800 --> 30:36.520
share some

30:36.520 --> 30:37.800
good news first.

30:39.040 --> 30:39.800
What good news?

30:39.920 --> 30:40.600
Seriously?

30:41.160 --> 30:42.120
No.

30:42.400 --> 30:42.920
Mom,

30:43.400 --> 30:44.120
you tell them.

30:47.840 --> 30:50.600
My livestream shopping account

30:51.200 --> 30:53.400
just hit 100,000 followers.

30:55.880 --> 30:57.400
You're a big influencer now.

30:57.560 --> 30:59.680
Cici, I told you you could make it.

30:59.760 --> 31:00.920
I just wanted to

31:01.200 --> 31:02.840
support Ye's work,

31:03.160 --> 31:05.000
help promote Zhazating,

31:05.160 --> 31:06.400
and sell some products.

31:07.160 --> 31:07.840
I didn't expect

31:07.960 --> 31:09.960
the sales to take off.

31:11.120 --> 31:11.960
That's incredible.

31:12.160 --> 31:12.960
I want to thank everyone

31:12.960 --> 31:13.800
for supporting me.

31:13.880 --> 31:14.440
Let me make a toast.

31:14.840 --> 31:15.760
Cheers.

31:15.840 --> 31:17.320
Keep it up.

31:17.600 --> 31:18.120
Okay.

31:18.240 --> 31:18.960
You got this.

31:22.360 --> 31:23.200
Mom, don't drink it all.

31:23.560 --> 31:24.560
I'm happy today.

31:24.800 --> 31:25.680
That's enough.

31:26.440 --> 31:27.800
That's impressive.

31:28.800 --> 31:30.160
- Nice!
- Nice!

31:30.320 --> 31:31.240
Wait a minute.

31:31.240 --> 31:32.160
Big G's here.

31:32.240 --> 31:33.240
- I'm so happy.
- He should make a toast too.

31:33.320 --> 31:33.920
This year,

31:34.520 --> 31:35.160
I got married.

31:35.520 --> 31:36.640
You all witnessed it.

31:37.000 --> 31:39.880
And it's my first year as a teacher.

31:40.200 --> 31:41.640
I've always wanted to thank

31:42.680 --> 31:44.120
two persons for helping me get here.

31:44.720 --> 31:45.920
Back then, if you hadn't

31:45.920 --> 31:46.920
been there with me through the gaokao,

31:47.280 --> 31:48.360
I never would've gone to

31:48.360 --> 31:49.000
the same

31:49.000 --> 31:50.160
college as Min.

31:51.880 --> 31:52.520
This one's to you.

31:53.160 --> 31:54.680
We were in it together.

31:56.000 --> 31:56.720
Bottoms up.

32:01.880 --> 32:02.640
Nice.

32:03.160 --> 32:04.120
That's cool.

32:04.160 --> 32:05.000
What do you mean?

32:05.560 --> 32:06.760
I didn't take the gaokao?

32:06.800 --> 32:08.040
Didn't I go through it with you?

32:08.120 --> 32:09.280
You are toasting each other

32:09.280 --> 32:10.920
and leaving me out?

32:11.720 --> 32:13.160
You have the nerve to complain?

32:13.280 --> 32:14.160
Look at them.

32:14.520 --> 32:15.520
One's got a girlfriend.

32:15.560 --> 32:16.560
The other is married.

32:16.840 --> 32:18.000
Then look at you.

32:18.240 --> 32:20.000
All you think about

32:20.040 --> 32:20.520
every day

32:20.520 --> 32:21.520
is just cars.

32:21.560 --> 32:22.800
If I were them,

32:23.080 --> 32:24.160
I wouldn't include you either.

32:24.160 --> 32:24.520
Right.

32:24.560 --> 32:25.280
Mom, if you keep pushing me,

32:25.280 --> 32:26.280
I'd run away from home.

32:26.840 --> 32:27.600
Don't you dare.

32:27.680 --> 32:28.320
With due respect,

32:28.520 --> 32:30.520
many people focus on their career first

32:30.520 --> 32:31.320
and then settle down.

32:31.560 --> 32:32.520
Exactly.

32:33.040 --> 32:34.120
Ye gets me.

32:34.680 --> 32:35.200
Love you.

32:36.440 --> 32:36.920
Oh, come on.

32:36.920 --> 32:37.920
Go find a girlfriend soon.

32:38.200 --> 32:38.640
Right.

32:44.160 --> 32:44.680
Han,

32:44.920 --> 32:46.000
I'm spending the holiday at Wu's place.

32:47.040 --> 32:47.600
Hi, Han.

32:47.640 --> 32:48.120
Hello.

32:48.200 --> 32:48.760
Han.

32:48.760 --> 32:49.920
Wow, so many people.

32:49.920 --> 32:50.400
Hi.

32:50.440 --> 32:51.040
Hi.

32:51.120 --> 32:51.840
Everyone, long time

32:51.840 --> 32:52.720
no see.

32:53.640 --> 32:54.200
Look

32:54.360 --> 32:55.160
who it is.

32:56.680 --> 32:57.520
Hey everyone,

32:57.800 --> 32:58.640
long time no see.

32:58.640 --> 32:59.560
Is that Ye Yingjian?

32:59.600 --> 33:00.680
Mr. Bowl Cut.

33:01.200 --> 33:02.040
Mr. Bowl Cut?

33:02.160 --> 33:02.680
What?

33:02.760 --> 33:04.000
I'm more handsome. You don't recognize me?

33:04.280 --> 33:04.920
Ye,

33:05.240 --> 33:06.440
you and Wu are

33:06.440 --> 33:08.080
always meant to be.

33:08.280 --> 33:09.240
Congratulations.

33:09.440 --> 33:10.120
Thank you.

33:10.720 --> 33:12.000
Mr. Ye, when are you coming back?

33:12.400 --> 33:13.720
Still keeping an eye on a few projects.

33:13.840 --> 33:14.680
I'll go back once I'm done.

33:15.120 --> 33:15.600
Okay.

33:16.000 --> 33:16.600
When you return,

33:17.000 --> 33:17.760
let's get together.

33:19.520 --> 33:20.120
Han,

33:20.280 --> 33:21.280
you've gotten even thinner.

33:22.240 --> 33:23.720
You need to take care of yourself.

33:23.800 --> 33:24.520
Really?

33:24.560 --> 33:25.600
Did I get thinner?

33:26.000 --> 33:27.080
Don't worry.

33:27.160 --> 33:28.360
I still wanna chase my dreams

33:28.360 --> 33:29.360
while I'm young.

33:29.560 --> 33:31.320
She used to want to stay close to home.

33:31.640 --> 33:32.200
Now she

33:32.680 --> 33:33.800
barely comes back once a year.

33:34.760 --> 33:35.600
People change.

33:36.080 --> 33:36.960
Han said the same thing.

33:37.960 --> 33:39.440
Women are so unpredictable.

33:41.520 --> 33:42.400
Who said I changed?

33:42.680 --> 33:43.640
What did I change?

33:43.880 --> 33:45.240
I'm still the same.

33:45.240 --> 33:46.720
All I think about is making money.

33:46.760 --> 33:47.800
I'm just

33:47.800 --> 33:48.840
in a different place.

33:49.000 --> 33:50.760
Han, don't listen to them.

33:50.800 --> 33:51.560
You haven't changed.

33:51.840 --> 33:53.520
Let me give you a toast.

33:53.720 --> 33:55.720
May your life be boundless

33:55.880 --> 33:57.160
and full of possibility.

33:57.320 --> 33:57.800
Cheers.

33:57.880 --> 33:58.680
Mr. Ye,

33:59.040 --> 33:59.760
meeting is ready.

34:00.080 --> 34:00.640
Okay.

34:00.880 --> 34:01.520
One second.

34:01.760 --> 34:02.560
We

34:02.880 --> 34:03.880
have a meeting soon.

34:04.320 --> 34:05.880
We'll catch up another time.

34:06.440 --> 34:07.960
Ye, thank you for the toast.

34:08.000 --> 34:08.560
Same to you.

34:09.440 --> 34:10.639
I'll go back to work then.

34:10.840 --> 34:11.960
Bye for now. Talk later.

34:11.960 --> 34:12.679
Bye, Han.

34:12.679 --> 34:13.159
Bye.

34:13.239 --> 34:13.760
Bye.

34:13.920 --> 34:14.719
Bye.

34:14.840 --> 34:15.560
Bye.

34:15.560 --> 34:16.120
Bye.

34:16.760 --> 34:17.560
Bye, Han.

34:19.679 --> 34:20.199
Wu,

34:20.679 --> 34:21.719
say a few words.

34:24.199 --> 34:24.840
My turn?

34:28.800 --> 34:29.880
Actually, when Ye

34:30.760 --> 34:31.679
left five years ago,

34:32.600 --> 34:33.880
I imagined what it

34:33.880 --> 34:35.520
would be like to see her again many times.

34:36.560 --> 34:37.400
And now

34:40.400 --> 34:41.920
it's finally happened.

34:44.120 --> 34:45.920
Oh, stop showing off.

34:46.440 --> 34:48.000
They're holding hands.

34:48.320 --> 34:49.679
This past year has been

34:50.159 --> 34:51.520
a dream come true for me.

34:52.679 --> 34:53.520
I'm lucky.

34:54.840 --> 34:55.719
And I'm happy.

34:56.239 --> 34:56.840
Good.

34:56.920 --> 34:57.440
Drink.

34:58.800 --> 34:59.600
I'll drink it up.

35:01.520 --> 35:02.200
That little?

35:02.520 --> 35:03.880
Come on, give me your glass.

35:05.200 --> 35:06.080
If he gets drunk,

35:06.080 --> 35:06.720
how's he getting home?

35:06.720 --> 35:07.520
That's enough.

35:07.720 --> 35:09.520
He's got Ye to take care of him.

35:14.440 --> 35:16.080
Not bad.

35:16.520 --> 35:17.520
That's the spirit.

35:17.520 --> 35:19.000
You can really hold your liquor.

35:21.520 --> 35:23.000
Honestly, before I came here,

35:23.720 --> 35:25.000
I never imagined

35:25.640 --> 35:26.680
so much

35:26.680 --> 35:27.600
would happen.

35:28.720 --> 35:29.240
Yeah.

35:30.440 --> 35:31.160
I remember

35:31.160 --> 35:32.360
when you first got here,

35:32.360 --> 35:33.320
you weren't used to anything here,

35:33.520 --> 35:34.400
not the food,

35:34.520 --> 35:35.400
not the place.

35:35.760 --> 35:36.920
Nothing felt right to you.

35:37.400 --> 35:38.440
I still remember

35:38.800 --> 35:39.520
the second day she was here,

35:39.520 --> 35:40.720
her eyes swollen and her ankle twisted,

35:40.800 --> 35:41.400
right?

35:41.760 --> 35:43.400
All I remember is Xing Wu

35:43.640 --> 35:45.000
picking on me every day.

35:45.080 --> 35:46.280
When did I pick on you?

35:46.320 --> 35:47.840
You were so hard to deal with back then.

35:47.960 --> 35:48.920
Say that again?

35:50.880 --> 35:52.360
But I slowly

35:52.880 --> 35:55.520
started to fit into life here.

35:56.800 --> 35:57.800
I gradually

35:58.360 --> 35:59.000
made friends.

35:59.640 --> 36:00.880
♪Two little bees♪

36:01.120 --> 36:02.320
♪fly among the flowers.♪

36:02.320 --> 36:03.520
♪Flying left, then flying right.♪

36:04.040 --> 36:06.760
Also, I've gained a family.

36:07.960 --> 36:09.520
Bit by bit, I learned

36:10.280 --> 36:12.040
the difference between wheat and weeds.

36:12.800 --> 36:13.640
And gradually

36:13.960 --> 36:15.800
I've realized there are things

36:16.080 --> 36:17.720
money just can't buy.

36:20.120 --> 36:21.800
Auntie, you love mahjong

36:22.600 --> 36:23.920
Sometimes you get a great hand,

36:24.000 --> 36:25.080
sometimes you

36:25.400 --> 36:26.600
start with a terrible one.

36:27.360 --> 36:28.440
But no matter what,

36:28.640 --> 36:30.880
even if you're dealt a bad hand,

36:31.640 --> 36:32.520
play

36:33.000 --> 36:34.440
your best and win.

36:34.600 --> 36:35.760
Well said.

36:35.760 --> 36:37.040
Now you've got it.

36:37.040 --> 36:37.600
- Come on.
- Anyway,

36:37.600 --> 36:39.080
wish you all peace and health.

36:39.640 --> 36:40.320
Happy holidays.

36:40.640 --> 36:43.160
Happy holidays. Cheers.

36:43.160 --> 36:44.120
Happy holidays.

36:47.880 --> 36:49.160
It's rare we're all together.

36:49.360 --> 36:50.240
Let's take a group photo.

36:50.600 --> 36:51.720
- Great idea.
- Come on.

36:54.200 --> 36:55.400
Three, two, one.

37:08.520 --> 37:10.640
Time really flies.

37:11.000 --> 37:12.440
Tata's gotten so big.

37:13.400 --> 37:15.320
And so many new faces too.

37:15.800 --> 37:16.760
In cat years,

37:17.520 --> 37:19.360
Tata's actually middle-aged,

37:19.680 --> 37:20.720
older than both of us.

37:22.360 --> 37:23.280
You can't compare like that.

37:23.280 --> 37:24.520
I'm nowhere near middle-aged.

37:24.880 --> 37:26.640
I'm forever 18 years old.

38:26.160 --> 38:26.960
Make a wish.

38:32.960 --> 38:34.560
I wanna spend every day

38:35.240 --> 38:36.520
of my life with you.

38:39.280 --> 38:40.080
We will.

38:51.320 --> 38:52.960
I wish this night

38:53.720 --> 38:55.040
would never end.

38:59.200 --> 38:59.840
Me too.

39:08.280 --> 39:08.800
Oh right,

39:09.240 --> 39:10.640
how's that speech Mr. Zhu asked you

39:10.640 --> 39:11.640
to prepare coming along?

39:13.960 --> 39:15.080
I came up with an opening.

39:15.680 --> 39:16.800
Hear this out.

39:17.680 --> 39:18.520
Six years ago,

39:19.120 --> 39:20.160
I was a troublemaker.

39:22.400 --> 39:23.440
Who starts a speech

39:23.440 --> 39:24.560
by putting themselves down?

39:25.000 --> 39:26.400
I'm setting up the contrast.

39:28.960 --> 39:30.120
What did I write after that?

39:30.240 --> 39:31.040
Let me think.

39:48.120 --> 39:48.920
Six years ago,

39:49.960 --> 39:51.000
I was a troublemaker.

39:53.400 --> 39:53.840
The kind

39:53.840 --> 39:55.600
teachers described as

39:56.440 --> 39:57.840
unfriendly to classmates

39:58.520 --> 40:00.080
and cold toward teachers.

40:01.080 --> 40:02.040
Back then, I thought

40:02.560 --> 40:04.240
some things just couldn't be changed.

40:05.080 --> 40:06.520
No matter how hard I tried,

40:07.000 --> 40:08.200
it was pointless.

40:08.920 --> 40:09.840
So I just

40:11.240 --> 40:12.760
gave up fighting

40:13.120 --> 40:14.080
and accepted my fate.

40:17.200 --> 40:18.400
But later, I realized

40:18.520 --> 40:19.160
I was wrong.

40:20.400 --> 40:21.080
Someone

40:22.040 --> 40:23.080
once told me

40:23.440 --> 40:25.400
Those painful days

40:26.400 --> 40:28.400
are like mud when the tide pulls back.

40:28.440 --> 40:29.520
It looks messy,

40:30.200 --> 40:30.920
but

40:32.400 --> 40:34.120
when the sun comes up,

40:34.680 --> 40:36.360
the broken shells catch

40:36.800 --> 40:37.800
the light and shimmer.

40:38.240 --> 40:39.280
These experiences

40:40.960 --> 40:41.520
are what

40:41.520 --> 40:43.680
shape you and make you unique.

40:49.640 --> 40:51.240
She knew there was a fire burning in me.

40:55.640 --> 40:57.080
[I never wanted to be ordinary.]

40:59.080 --> 41:00.320
[I wanted to make something of myself.]

41:01.840 --> 41:02.960
[I had dreams too.]

41:06.080 --> 41:07.520
[They felt so out of reach,]

41:10.640 --> 41:11.680
[but I'm glad]

41:14.280 --> 41:15.840
[I never stopped]

41:15.840 --> 41:17.520
[chasing them.]

41:20.240 --> 41:20.960
[Run forward.]

41:22.040 --> 41:22.720
[Don't look back.]

41:25.440 --> 41:26.360
[Like all of you,]

41:27.640 --> 41:28.920
[someone saw potential in me.]

41:29.880 --> 41:30.760
[And I believe]

41:32.600 --> 41:33.880
[I can fight my way to a better life.]

41:39.240 --> 41:40.040
She also told me

41:42.040 --> 41:43.960
no one is born inferior.

41:45.200 --> 41:46.640
We all have it in us to shine.

41:51.120 --> 41:51.800
I believe her.

41:54.920 --> 41:56.680
And I believe everyone here

41:57.880 --> 41:59.080
can have

42:00.080 --> 42:01.320
a brilliant future.

42:34.800 --> 42:35.920
[A lot of people say]

42:36.720 --> 42:39.520
[I changed Xing Wu.]

42:41.360 --> 42:42.120
[But he]

42:43.080 --> 42:44.400
[changed me just as much.]

42:46.120 --> 42:47.320
[Before I met him,]

42:48.200 --> 42:49.880
[I thought there was only one way]

42:49.880 --> 42:50.640
[life could shine,]

42:52.280 --> 42:53.440
[fearless, passionate,]

42:54.040 --> 42:54.960
[with no restraint.]

42:56.680 --> 42:57.600
[After I met him,]

42:57.600 --> 42:58.400
[I learned that]

42:59.960 --> 43:02.040
[weeds grow from ash,]

43:03.520 --> 43:06.120
[sunlight seeps through cracks,]

43:07.280 --> 43:09.200
[ordinary life has its beauty,]

43:10.240 --> 43:12.920
[and that hope can rise from despair.]

43:14.440 --> 43:16.840
[That is the power of life.]

43:36.520 --> 43:38.240
Cheese.
